{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は「嫌われ松子の一生」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香の赤い熱情編みてきたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松子としての危うさや愛らしさ、狂気"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅力満載だったぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リミッターの外れたような叫び声が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい迫力でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒の若月とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松子の人物像も違ってみえたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取り巻く男たちとの関係性も異なるように思えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方面白かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも稽古からハードスケジュールの中だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽まで身体に気をつけて頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夜は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6年前、舞台「アルプスの少女ハイジ」で共演させていただいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"藤田朋子さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても楽しかった〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽の素敵なアンサンブルにたっぷりのトーク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から笑って、幸せなひと時でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"藤田さんの歌や表情に惹きつけられっ放しでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていてこちらまで気持ちよくなったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウキウキしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心がキュッとなったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もそんな歌を歌えるようになりたいっ"},